\fs28 \cf0 Agent pattern with DAG execution\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Each data source is implemented as a subclass of 
\f2\fs26 BaseIngestionAgent
\f1\fs24  with an abstract interface: 
\f2\fs26 check_for_updates() 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  bool
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 fetch_data() 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  list
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 transform_data(raw) 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  list
\f1\fs24 , and 
\f2\fs26 load_data(transformed) 
\f4 \uc0\u8594 
\f2  IngestionResult
\f1\fs24 . Configuration is YAML-driven, specifying schedule (cron), dependencies, source type (
\f2\fs26 REST_API
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 CSV
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 XML
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 GIT_REPO
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 JSON_FEED
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 GCS_BUCKET
\f1\fs24 ), and source-specific parameters.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

