\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Monitoring, Docker deployment, and production hardening\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Instrument every agent with 
\f0\b Prometheus metrics
\f1\b0 : 
\f2\fs26 ingestion_records_total
\f1\fs24  (Counter by source/operation), 
\f2\fs26 ingestion_duration_seconds
\f1\fs24  (Histogram), 
\f2\fs26 ingestion_errors_total
\f1\fs24  (Counter), and 
\f2\fs26 ingestion_last_success_timestamp
\f1\fs24  (Gauge). Alert on staleness (e.g., EPSS not updated in 48 hours) and duration anomalies. Use 
\f0\b structlog
\f1\b0  for structured JSON logging with source name, record counts, and durations in every log line.\
The Docker Compose stack runs four services: 
\f0\b ArangoDB 3.12
\f1\b0  (with healthcheck on 
\f2\fs26 /_api/version
\f1\fs24 , 4 GB memory limit), 
\f0\b ingestion-engine
\f1\b0  (multi-stage build from Python 3.12-slim, non-root user, volume mounts for git repos and cached data), 
\f0\b Prometheus
\f1\b0 , and 
\f0\b Grafana
\f1\b0 . Secrets (
\f2\fs26 NVD_API_KEY
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 GITHUB_TOKEN
\f1\fs24 , 
\f2\fs26 ARANGO_ROOT_PASSWORD
\f1\fs24 ) should use 
\f2\fs26 .env
\f1\fs24  files excluded from version control, escalating to HashiCorp Vault for production.\
Data validation via 
\f0\b Pydantic models
\f1\b0  catches malformed records before insertion. Audit logging to an 
\f2\fs26 _ingestion_audit
\f1\fs24  ArangoDB collection tracks every run's record counts, duration, source version, and git commit SHA. ArangoDB backups via 
\f2\fs26 arangodump
\f1\fs24  should be scheduled daily with 7-day retention. Graceful shutdown uses 
\f2\fs26 asyncio.Event
